<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenia Feb gross wages up 14.1 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Slovenia Feb gross wages up 14.1 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Slovenian Statistical Office reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p>    AVERAGE GROSS WAGES    Feb     Jan    Feb 96</p>
<p>    in tolars		 136,811 138,586 119,913</p>
<p>    monthly change (pct)  -1.3     -1.6    +0.2</p>
<p>    yr/yt change (pct)   +14.1    +15.8   +12.4</p>
<p>-- Marja Novak, Ljubljana newsroom, 386-61-125-8439</p>
</text>
